\newlabel{fig:offsetmap}{{12}{11}{Heatmap of steering action offsets for MLP (left) and 1DCNN (right) across varying heading (H) and wind (W) conditions. The color gradient represents the difference between consecutive actions ($\Delta a_t = a_t - a_{t-1}$), where 0 (white) indicates a maintained course and 2 (dark red/blue) indicates maximum rudder deflection.\relax }{figure.caption.13}{}}
